START
Read number of packages
Read package weights and values
Read maximum capacity

Set maximum value = 0

Generate all possible package combinations

FOR each combination
    Calculate total weight
    Calculate total value

    IF total weight <= capacity
        IF total value > maximum value
            Update maximum value
            Store selected packages
        END IF
    END IF
END FOR

Display selected packages
Display total weight
Display maximum value
Display combinations examined
STOP
